docs/threads.md:127:The workflow log of each run on a thread shows these commands for that thread at the start of the run, in the group `🧵 Thread refs/pi/threads/<number>`. Each comment of pi-action ends with these commands for its thread, in a collapsed section: `🧵 This conversation is stored in git on refs/pi/threads/<number>`. In `output` mode, pi-action posts no comment, so the job summary of the run shows the commands.
